---
description:
  Verifies that the subGraphTitleMargin config renders correctly for a
  left-to-right flowchart containing nested subgraphs with mixed inner
  directions (TB, RL, BT), using the default htmlLabels rendering.
config:
  layout: layered
  flowchart:
    subGraphTitleMargin:
      top: 10
      bottom: 5
copyOf: flowchart/visual-check/should-render-subgraphs-with-title-margins-set-lr.mmd
---
flowchart LR

  subgraph TOP
  direction TB
  subgraph B1
      direction RL
      i1 -->f1
  end
  subgraph B2
      direction BT
      i2 -->f2
  end
  end
  A --> TOP --> B
  B1 --> B2
